== Resource districts ==
Resource districts provide some additional housing and create jobs that generate {{iconify|energy}}, {{iconify|minerals}}, or {{iconify|food}}. Each resource district can support a single [[District specialization#Generator specializations|resource specialization]], typically unlocked after researching a certain technology.

=== Planetary resource districts ===
The number of planetary resource districts that can be built is typically limited by [[planetary features]], but can be expanded by [[planet modifiers]] or [[Resource buildings#Resource district buildings|resource district buildings]]. Under certain conditions, resource districts buildings can be built without a planetary feature limit, limited only by the planet's total district capacity, similar to urban districts. These districts are not available to empires with the {{iconify|Wilderness}} origin.
